# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# gen-l10n diagnostic output (untranslated-messages-file in l10n.yaml) — a
# build artifact, regenerated on every run, never a committed source file.
l10n-untranslated.json
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Third-party agent skills installed by `npx skills add` (Leonxlnx/taste-skill).
# The installer drops them in the working tree and symlinks them into
# .claude/skills/. They are local tooling, not project source: skills-lock.json
# records the source and a content hash of each, so the set is reproducible
# without carrying 6800 lines of someone else's design prose in this repo.
# The negations keep our OWN skill and its README tracked.
/.agents/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/vitomy-design/
!.claude/skills/README.md
